2. (1) In this Act, unless the context otherwise requires—
"article" includes device, contrivance, machine or equipment;

"Assistant Controller" means an Assistant Controller of Optical
Discs appointed under section 3;

"code of conduct" means the code of conduct issued under
section 22;

"Controller" means the Controller of Optical Discs appointed
under section 3;

